WEBVTT

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:02.310
Read the package as someone who has not heard your

00:00:02.357 --> 00:00:03.181
conversation.

00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:06.014
Can they tell which documents govern a behavior?

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.382
Can they identify the first safe action?

00:00:08.766 --> 00:00:11.505
Is each important claim paired with appropriate evidence?

00:00:11.947 --> 00:00:14.257
Does the plan say what stays unchanged?

00:00:14.698 --> 00:00:17.113
Are failures and uncertain effects recoverable?

00:00:17.554 --> 00:00:19.029
Use the rubric below.

00:00:19.354 --> 00:00:21.978
Revise the package where a fresh reader must guess.

00:00:22.419 --> 00:00:25.995
A successful capstone is clear, bounded, testable,

00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:29.501
authorized at the appropriate stage, and restartable.
